WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
The mitzvah requires the correct willow species

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.760
and condition.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.280
Identify what is actually needed.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.200
An appealing substitute does not become valid

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.580
simply because it is convenient.
